  (text "Molex 503480-4000 / 1.0mm height\n40-way, 0.50mm pitch, dual-contact FFC\n0.30 +/-0.03mm mating thickness\nPins 35-40: NC, no electrode connection.\nMP pads: mechanical retention, NC.\nExternal cable strain relief required.\nCable: Molex 0151660431, Type A, 102mm.\nSee prefab-20261001/FFC-MATING.md."
    (at 20 173 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "6df82cc4-2ef2-4d8a-a05a-84113771a071"))
  (text "FILTER BASIS / RELEASE LIMITS"
    (at 20 218 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.6 1.6)
        (bold yes))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "86650734-ceed-491e-a658-0410c15e0c0d"))
  (text "TI SLAU443B, Fig. 59: 4.99k + 4.7nF\nto ground per input. Same RC on REF.\nNominal pole: 6.79 kHz for zero source Z.\nThese are EMI filters, not 250 Hz\nanti-alias filters or patient protection.\nElectrode impedance changes bandwidth.\nValidate leakage, ESD, powered-off faults,\nnoise and common-mode rejection.\nNo external amplifier is added."
    (at 20 228 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "c4bb6b39-d74c-4505-89f4-5c1a83cce3e3"))
  (text "J601.33 -> ReferenceBias / EEG_REF\nJ601.34 <- ReferenceBias / EEG_BIAS\nREF and BIAS are separate electrodes.\nNo rail or GND contact goes to the scalp."
    (at 20 300 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "cff24006-e759-4285-a601-b9fe542e8c54"))
